  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development Talk 2014 Economic Development</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Development Talk 2014 Ekonomisk utveckling</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med evenemanget &#xe4;r att diskutera hur man minskar fattigdomen genom att uppn&#xe5; mer inkl ekonomisk tillv&#xe4;xt och en h&#xe5;llbar utveckling samt roller och ansvarsomr&#xe5;den f&#xf6;r regeringar, internationella organisationer, f&#xf6;retag och fackliga organisationer f&#xf6;r att se till detta. Seminariet kommer att presentera nya globala r&#xf6;n fr&#xe5;n ILO om tillv&#xe4;xt mm.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the event is to discuss to how maximize poverty reduction by achieving more inclusive economic growth and sustainable development as well as the roles and responsibilities of governments, international organizations, businesses and trade unions to ensure that no one is left behind. As such, the seminar will present recent global findings from the ILO regarding the inclusive growth- poverty</narrative>
  </description>
